### List clients (seeded: Ana, Marko, Elena)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients

### Create a client
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Petar"
}

### Ana's balance (expect 860.00 from seeded data)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/balance

### Ana's holdings (expect AAPL: 2)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/holdings

### Ana's transaction history
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/transactions

### Deposit cash
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "deposit",
  "amount": 200
}

### Buy an instrument
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "buy",
  "instrument": "MSFT",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price_per_unit": 50
}

### Sell an instrument (price can differ from purchase price)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "sell",
  "instrument": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 1,
  "price_per_unit": 130
}

### Rejected: withdrawal beyond balance -> expect 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "withdrawal",
  "amount": 999999
}

### Rejected: sell more than owned -> expect 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "sell",
  "instrument": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 999,
  "price_per_unit": 100
}
